WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.988
"Bɩ d zẽk pʋʋg ne taab n pʋɩ koodã pʋɩ-sʋka".

00:00:04.068 --> 00:00:05.795
A ra sakame tao-tao.

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:16.100
La sã n wa yaa wa bõn-buud sẽn wilgdẽ, la a sẽn bʋdd la a wʋk gõosã, bõn-bilã ra gũuda pʋʋgã, la b ra yãgd-a lame.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.908
B sẽn wa n yãgdẽ wã.

00:00:17.988 --> 00:00:25.410
La b sẽn wa n tigsd koodã, b pidsa tẽn-kʋdgã sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩg sãnem tus a yiibu.
